"  3. The device installs the update by itself. It may ask whether to install "
"it:\n"
"     choose to install now. It may also restart. Wait until it has "
"finished.\n"
"  4. Reconnect it and run `openexpress updates`: the installed update\n"
"     should no longer be listed.\n"
