#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Install watch software updates and free maps such as TopoActive"
msgstr ""

#: openexpress/data/io.github.tomaszbojanowski.OpenExpress.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Install, update and remove Connect IQ apps and watch faces"
